Over many years, the two of them ran AIG exclusively,

13
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:42,379
first Starr and then Greenberg.

14
00:00:42,379 --> 00:00:53,300
And Greenberg produced a very innovative, innovative

15
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:54,980
insurance giant.

16
00:00:54,980 --> 00:00:57,199
It didn't end well, but I

17
00:00:57,199 --> 00:00:59,419
