21
00:01:06,759 --> 00:01:12,039
Once again, no one can control everything that happens.

22
00:01:12,039 --> 00:01:18,060
And random shocks affect all of our lives.

23
00:01:18,060 --> 00:01:20,299
He remains a very important, he's

24
00:01:20,299 --> 00:01:22,539
